@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
title SEQ-008 — Presence, listeners and health
footer APPROVED D-016 DEC-076 | UC-030, UC-031, UC-032

actor Tourist
actor Staff
participant Browser
participant "Usage Monitoring" as Usage
database "Usage DB" as DB
participant "Identity & Staff" as Identity
participant "POI / worker status API" as Health
Tourist -> Browser: Open / Play / Pause / End
opt Online
 Browser -> Usage: 30s browser/playback heartbeat; end event when available
 Usage -> DB: Server timestamps; deduplicate browser and playback
end
Staff -> Usage: Dashboard refresh every 30s
Usage -> Identity: Verify current employee access
alt Authorized
 Usage -> DB: Count distinct browsers; exclude >90s stale
 Usage -> Health: Read dependency/job state via API
 Health --> Usage: State / unavailable
 Usage --> Staff: Counts + timestamps + dependency state
else Identity unavailable / denied
 Usage --> Staff: Error; UI marks old values stale, not zero
end
note over Browser,DB: Pause does not end listener; no location history or IP visitor identity

@enduml
